    "rule_name": "Auto-Elevating Binary Spawned Interpreter After User-Hive Handler Write",
    "severity": "high",
    "analyst_priority": "P2",
    "description": "A process wrote a shell-open command handler under the current user's HKCU Classes hive and an auto-elevating signed Windows binary subsequently launched a command interpreter. Auto-elevating binaries run at high integrity without a consent prompt; if they resolve a handler from a user-writable hive, an unprivileged process can have its own command executed at high integrity.",
